      "description": "首页和工具页共用的完整链接行。",
      "html": "<a class=\"ds-index\" href=\"#\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"3\" y=\"11\" width=\"18\" height=\"11\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v4\"/></svg><span><strong>密码生成</strong><small>生成随机密码</small></span><svg class=\"ds-index-arrow\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14m-7-7 7 7-7 7\"/></svg></a>",
      "css": ".ds-index{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.875rem;min-height:5.75rem;padding:1.25rem .5rem;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border, #e0d3c8);border-radius:.25rem;color:var(--foreground, #342b27);font-family:system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", sans-serif;text-decoration:none;transition:background-color 150ms,color 150ms}.ds-index:hover{background:var(--muted, #f4eee7)}.ds-index:active{background:var(--accent, #ead9cd)}.ds-index:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--ring, #873e4a);outline-offset:4px}.ds-index>svg{width:1.25rem;height:1.25rem;flex-shrink:0;color:var(--muted-foreground, #74675d)}.ds-index strong{display:block;font-size:.875rem;font-weight:550}.ds-index small{display:block;margin-top:.375rem;color:var(--muted-foreground, #74675d);font-size:.8125rem;line-height:1.7}.ds-index .ds-index-arrow{width:1rem;height:1rem;margin-left:auto;color:var(--primary, #873e4a)}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-index{transition-duration:0s}}"
