      "description": "对应现有 SalarySettings 的双态外观；预览为原生按钮，不接管应用状态。",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-switch\" role=\"switch\" aria-checked=\"true\" aria-label=\"显示工资区\"><span></span></button>",
      "css": ".ds-switch{position:relative;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;width:32px;height:18.4px;padding:0;border:1px solid transparent;border-radius:9999px;background:var(--input, #978376);cursor:pointer;transition:all 150ms cubic-bezier(.4,0,.2,1)}.ds-switch::after{content:\"\";position:absolute;inset:-.5rem -.75rem}.ds-switch[aria-checked=\"true\"]{background:var(--primary, #873e4a)}.ds-switch span{display:block;width:16px;height:16px;border-radius:9999px;background:var(--background, #faf7f2);transition:transform 150ms cubic-bezier(.4,0,.2,1)}.ds-switch[aria-checked=\"true\"] span{transform:translateX(calc(100% - 2px))}.ds-switch:focus-visible{outline:none;border-color:var(--ring, #873e4a);box-shadow:0 0 0 3px color-mix(in srgb,var(--ring, #873e4a) 50%,transparent);}.ds-switch:disabled{opacity:.5;cursor:not-allowed}:host-context(.dark) .ds-switch[aria-checked=\"true\"] span{background:var(--primary-foreground, #fffdf9)}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-switch{transition-duration:0s}}"
    }
  ],
  "narrative": {
